1
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:24,260
The path to paradise begins in hell.

2
00:10:36,521 --> 00:10:42,521
Alien: Covenant is a horror, science fiction,
thriller film directed by Ridley Scott.

3
00:15:54,782 --> 00:16:00,782
The crew of the colony ship Covenant, bound for a remote planet on the far side of the galaxy,
discovers what they think is an uncharted paradise but is actually a dark, dangerous world.

4
00:21:13,043 --> 00:21:19,043
David / Walter, played by Michael Fassbender.

5
00:26:31,304 --> 00:26:37,304
Daniels, played by Katherine Waterston.

6
00:31:49,565 --> 00:31:55,565
Oram, played by Billy Crudup.

7
00:37:07,826 --> 00:37:13,826
Tennessee, played by Danny McBride.

8
00:42:26,086 --> 00:42:32,086
Lope, played by Demián Bichir.

9
00:47:44,347 --> 00:47:50,347
Karine, played by Carmen Ejogo.

10
00:53:02,608 --> 00:53:08,608
Alien: Covenant is a 2017  science fiction horror film directed and co-produced by Ridley Scott from a
screenplay by John Logan and Dante Harper, based on a story by Michael Green and Jack Paglen.

11
00:58:20,869 --> 00:58:26,869
It is the sixth installment in the Alien film series
and the sequel to Prometheus (2012).

12
01:03:39,130 --> 01:03:45,130
It features returning star Michael Fassbender, with Katherine Waterston, Billy
Crudup, Danny McBride, and Demián Bichir in supporting roles.

13
01:08:57,391 --> 01:09:03,391
It follows the crew of a colony ship that lands on an
uncharted planet and makes a terrifying discovery.

14
01:14:15,652 --> 01:14:21,652
In 2012, before the release of Prometheus, Scott discussed the prospects of a
sequel and new trilogy, and this film was confirmed that August.

15
01:19:33,913 --> 01:19:39,913
Principal photography began on April 4, 2016, at Milford Sound in Fiordland
National Park, New Zealand, and wrapped on July 19, 2016.

16
01:24:52,173 --> 01:24:58,173
Effects houses Odd Studios and CreatureNFX provided the
film's makeup and animatronic creature effects.

17
01:30:10,434 --> 01:30:16,434
Scott said the film's first cut was 2 hours and 23 minutes,
which was edited down by over twenty minutes.

18
01:35:28,695 --> 01:35:34,695
Alien: Covenant premiered in London on May 4, 2017.

19
01:40:46,956 --> 01:40:52,956
It was released by 20th Century Fox on May 12 in the United
Kingdom, and on May 19 in the United States.

20
01:46:05,217 --> 01:46:11,217
It received generally positive reviews from critics but was considered a box office
disappointment, grossing $240 million against a production budget of $97–111 million.

21
01:51:23,478 --> 01:51:29,478
The film explores themes of android, spacecraft,
experiment, space travel, infection.

22
01:56:41,739 --> 01:56:47,739
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and intense.
